# Offline rVV10 pin notes — gpw-rvv10-ice

## CP2K full-QS twin (2026.1)

Host: Arrhenius tree install `work/cp2k/install` (GCC 11.5, libxc, FFTW3).
Input: `water_dimer_rvv10.inp` (this directory).

```text
CP2K 2026.1  TYPE RVV10  PARAMETERS 6.3 0.0093
geometry: water dimer 12 Å cubic, DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH + GTH-PBE, CUTOFF 200
Dispersion energy = 0.06116467960721 Ha
Total energy      = -34.27712583714492 Ha
wall ≈ 121 s (OMP=8)
SCF converged in 35 OT steps
```

Note: CP2K applies rVV10 **self-consistently**. ATV product path is
**post-SCF** on the final PBE density (same policy as `gpw-vdw-df-ice`).
The dual-frozen regression pin is the post-SCF ATV E_disp; CP2K value is
the literature-aligned cross-check for sign and scale.

## Kernel tables

CP2K `data/rVV10_kernel_table.dat` (nqs=20, nr=1024, r_max=100 Bohr) is
embedded float32+zlib as `rvv10_kernel_data.cpp` — no runtime file I/O.
